# What Plan2001 takes from 9front (tools/9front.release), for
# tools/import9front: the kernel and loader, the compilers and mk for the
# three targets' toolchains, the libraries they and the kernel link, and
# the few programs a self-hosting root needs to fetch its source (git over
# https: webfs, ip/ipconfig, ndb) and build it.  Everything else is
# Monolith's (docs/selfhost.md).
#   PATH        a file or a whole directory, from the 9front root
#   !PATH       not that (inside a directory above)
# A file this repo already has is Plan2001's own and is never overwritten.

# the targets' headers and mk definitions (riscv64: no compiler in 9front)
amd64/include/u.h
amd64/include/ureg.h
amd64/mkfile
arm64/include/u.h
arm64/include/ureg.h
arm64/mkfile

